ing to a report from the hollywood  reporter which is a very  very credible website instead of coming  in december of 2020 the one division  series is now set to arrive on disney  plus in spring of 2021  so luckily and hopefully it's only been  pushed back a few months  now for those of you thinking that we  may not get a trailer because of this  this doesn't necessarily mean that we  won't be getting a teaser trailer for  the one division show anytime soon in  fact we most likely will  in the hollywood reporters report they  do say that all of the filming for the  one division series has  wrapped meaning they have shot  everything that they need to shoot  so everything is in post-production now  what this means is that  marvel has all the footage that they  need to make a trailer  after all we did already see a little  teaser trailer during the super bowl so  marvel has everything they need to  release a trailer for the one division  series  and marvel definitely knows that all of  the marvel and mcu fans are suffering  right now we're super bummed that we  haven't got the black widow film  all of the disney plush shows have been  pushed back and really the entire  mcu phase 4 slate has been delayed they  know all of this and they're good to  their fans  and lately there's been a lot of reports  stating that we could be getting  a bunch of new trailers very soon so  fingers crossed for that and  like i said we'll end it on some good  news in regards to  the hawkeye series the hollywood  reporter has also reported that the  hawkeye series has found  a couple of directors as it turns out  the hawkeye series is going to be very  much like the mandalorian the  mandalorian had various different  directors for  different episodes and it turned out to  be fantastic  well that's apparently what they're  going to be doing with the hawkeye  series as well  and marvel studios has officially hired  amber finlayson and katie elwood to  direct a few episodes of the hawkeye  series and they've also hired  ryze thomas to direct a few episodes as  well but the most  interesting and most exciting part about  this report is what it mentions of kate  bishop  it says one of the arcs of the series is  barton's mentoring of a new generation  of archer  kate bishop haley steinfeld was  previously in negotiations for the part  but it's unclear if her deal is closed  marvel had no comment this is pretty  much the first time that we've got  an official confirmation that haley  steinfeld has actually spoke  with marvel studios and negotiated about  the role  everything else was pretty much  speculation and fan casting but this  report is  official now when the hollywood reporter  asked marvel if haley steinfeld was  going to be  kate bishop they had no comment which  means she's still in the running which  is great news because  haley steinfeld is pretty much the fan  favorite to play the role of kate bishop  so all of those reports that said she is  out and not playing the role she is not  out  yet but let me know what you think about  this news in the comments down below how  excited would you be to see hayley  steinfeld play kate bishop and let me  know which marvel phase 4 project you're  looking forward to the most  don't forget to give this video a like  and subscribe so you can stay up to date  on everything relating to the mcu and  what's happening don't forget to follow  me on instagram and twitter and as  always thank you all so much for  watching  woof
 

